function project(p){switch($('plane').value){case'xz':return[p[0],p[2]];case'yz':return[p[1],p[2]];case'iso':return[(p[0]-p[1])*.707,(p[0]+p[1])*.35+p[2]*.866];default:return[p[0],p[1]]}}
function drawPlot(){if(!state.card||!$('detail').open)return;const canvas=$('detailPlot'),box=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),ratio=devicePixelRatio||1,w=box.width,h=box.height;canvas.width=w*ratio;canvas.height=h*ratio;const c=canvas.getContext('2d');c.scale(ratio,ratio);if(severity(state.card)==='failure'){c.clearRect(0,0,w,h);c.fillStyle='#a2b4c8';c.font='14px Segoe UI';c.fillText('Red diagnostic: trajectory plot skipped',24,40);return;}const all=state.card.paths.flat().concat([[0,0,0]]).map(project),xs=all.map(p=>p[0]),ys=all.map(p=>p[1]),xmin=Math.min(...xs),xmax=Math.max(...xs),ymin=Math.min(...ys),ymax=Math.max(...ys),scale=Math.min((w-110)/Math.max(xmax-xmin,.1),(h-90)/Math.max(ymax-ymin,.1))*plot.zoom,cx=(xmin+xmax)/2,cy=(ymin+ymax)/2;const point=p=>{const[x,y]=project(p);return[w/2+(x-cx)*scale+plot.panX,h/2-(y-cy)*scale+plot.panY]};function line(ps,color,lw){if(!ps.length)return;c.beginPath();c.moveTo(...point(ps[0]));for(const p of ps.slice(1))c.lineTo(...point(p));c.strokeStyle=color;c.lineWidth=lw;c.stroke()}for(const orbit of state.card.planet_paths)if(bodyVisible(orbit.body,'orbits'))line(orbit.points,'#2c415a',.8);const colors=['#69d6ff','#7de0b4','#ffcf83','#c5a3ff','#fcaacb'];state.card.paths.forEach((p,i)=>line(p,colors[i%colors.length],1.9));let sun=point([0,0,0]);c.beginPath();c.arc(...sun,5,0,2*Math.PI);c.fillStyle='#ffda78';c.fill();c.font='11px Segoe UI';for(const e of state.card.events){if(!bodyVisible(e.body,'markers'))continue;const p=point(e.planet_state_km_kms.slice(0,3).map(v=>v/149597870.7));c.beginPath();c.arc(...p,3,0,2*Math.PI);c.fillStyle='#e1edff';c.fill();const label=e.body+' '+e.date.slice(0,10),width=c.measureText(label).width;c.fillText(label,Math.max(8,Math.min(w-width-10,p[0]+7)),Math.max(14,Math.min(h-20,p[1]-8)))}c.fillStyle='#7894b4';c.fillText('AU · equal projected axis scale',12,h-13)}
